        " : سَأَلْتُهُ عَنْ أَخٍ لِأَبٍ وَ جَدٍّ قَالَ \"اَلْمَالُ بَيْنَهُمَا سَوَاءٌ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5637 - Ibn Mahbub narrated from Abdullah ibn Sinan from Abu Abdullah (as) who said:\nI asked Imam (as) about a paternal brother and a grandfather (in matters of inheritance).\nImam (as) replied: \"The inheritance is divided equally between them.\""
        ]
      }
